rld-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/114668-ask-a-simple-question-awakened-edition?p=1472747#post1472747\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> So, would altering your signature nimbus to encode a message work then, assuming your target then examines the Signature Nimbus that is now on them? It\u2019s not perfect, but I think it\u2019s better than my previous idea of relying on PMS.</div> </div> </div> </div>It... might... but at that point you're casting at least two spells just to reach that Ping point. One to alter your aura, one to &quot;contact&quot; the other person. So it'll be a bit time consuming, if not mana-consuming. You won't be able to use the ping spell as a Rote, for example, since Rotes override your default resonance.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-01-18T20:42:28-08:00","id":1472749,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cauthon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/114668-ask-a-simple-question-awakened-edition?p=1472748#post1472748\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> It... might... but at that point you're casting at least two spells just to reach that Ping point. One to alter your aura, one to &quot;contact&quot; the other person. So it'll be a bit time consuming, if not mana-consuming. You won't be able to use the ping spell as a Rote, for example, since Rotes override your default resonance.</div> </div> </div> </div> erm, technically Rotes don\u2019t hide the Signature Nimbus, just makes the identity of the sender indistinct. The first spell could account for that, or even still make it look like it was from you. But your other points are valid. <br /> <br /> Well, that\u2019s all I\u2019ve got then. A cell phone still works better.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-01-18T20:44:50-08:00","id":1472750,"title":"","content":"